<div class="footnote"><p><a id="Footnote_14_14"></a><a href="#FNanchor_14_14" class="pginternal"><span class="label">[14]</span></a> See <i>ante</i>, p. <a href="#Page_120" class="pginternal">120</a>.</p></div>
<div class="footnote"><p><a id="Footnote_15_15"></a><a href="#FNanchor_15_15" class="pginternal"><span class="label">[15]</span></a> There is an earlier allusion I may quote, from a letter in January,
