<div class="footnote"><p><a id="Footnote_16_16"></a><a href="#FNanchor_16_16" class="pginternal"><span class="label">[16]</span></a> See <i>ante</i>, p. <a href="#Page_113" class="pginternal">113</a>.</p></div>
<div class="footnote"><p><a id="Footnote_17_17"></a><a href="#FNanchor_17_17" class="pginternal"><span class="label">[17]</span></a> Here is another of the same month: "All day I have been at work
on <i>Oliver</i>, and hope to finish the chapter by bedtime. I wish you'd
