"and three others" dined together in the Palais Royal.</p></div>
<div class="footnote"><p><a id="Footnote_207_207"></a><a href="#FNanchor_207_207" class="pginternal"><span class="label">[207]</span></a> The framework for this sketch was a graphic description, also done
