<div class="footnote"><p><a id="Footnote_238_238"></a><a href="#FNanchor_238_238" class="pginternal"><span class="label">[238]</span></a> From the same letter, dated 1st of July 1861, I take what follows.
"Poor Lord Campbell's seems to me as easy and good a death as one
could desire. There must be a sweep of these men very soon, and
