that class of criminal almost invariably <i>was</i> a Jew. But surely no
sensible man or woman of your persuasion can fail to observe—firstly,
that all the rest of the wicked <i>dramatis personæ</i> are Christians; and,
secondly, that he is called 'The Jew,' not because of his religion, but
because of his race."</p></div>
<div class="footnote"><p><a id="Footnote_272_272"></a><a href="#FNanchor_272_272" class="pginternal"><span class="label">[272]</span></a> Mr. Marcus Stone had, upon the separate issue of the <i>Tale of
