<div class="footnote"><p><a id="Footnote_273_273"></a><a href="#FNanchor_273_273" class="pginternal"><span class="label">[273]</span></a> He thus spoke of it in his "Postscript in lieu of Preface" (dated
2nd of September 1865), which accompanied the last number of the
