home (as to them) without loss."</p></div>
<div class="footnote"><p><a id="Footnote_282_282"></a><a href="#FNanchor_282_282" class="pginternal"><span class="label">[282]</span></a> The close of the letter has an amusing picture which I may be
excused for printing in a note. "The only news that will interest you
